## How to read notifications

The bell icon in the top bar shows your "Notifications". A number on the bell shows how many are new. The system sends notifications for events such as:

- a new invoice was created (for people who can view invoices);
- a job move needs approval (for approvers);
- your approval request was approved or rejected;
- a job was moved to your department after approval.

Click a notification to open the related record. Use "Mark all read" to mark every notification as read, or "Clear all" to remove them. The system can also ask to show browser notifications. Click "Enable" to allow them or "Not now" to skip.
